Falsifies `grant_plan::expansion::verification::a_batch_is_the_front_of_the_byte_order`.

The defect: a name offered to a batch goes before the first name that sorts below it instead of after, so the batch is no longer in byte order.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert_eq!(names.ends[i], end)`, since the name offered lands first.

